      { criterion: "Influencing and communication", competent: "Executive brief leads with the decision required and uses the asset's own data; viva presentation is clear and handles challenge.", distinction: "Sponsor confirms decisions taken or resources committed as a result; presentation is compelling to a non-specialist leadership audience." },
      { criterion: "Facilitation (observed HP-1)", competent: "Meets the pathway delivery standard on every criterion; local scenarios used; psychological safety maintained.", distinction: "Exceptional adaptation to the group, skilful handling of challenge, and evaluation evidence of strong learning." },
      { criterion: "Viva: breadth and judgement", competent: "Answers unseen questions across the seven modules accurately and applies them to new situations.", distinction: "Shows critical judgement about the limits of methods and evidence, and articulates a clear personal practice as an HP lead." }
